LunaAgent __VERSION__ (Beta)
============================

Beta line (0.x.y). Expect change until 1.0.0.

Which package?
--------------
  macOS 13 Ventura or newer  ->  LunaAgent_13plus.pkg
  macOS 10.14-12             ->  LunaAgent_Legacy_10.14.pkg

  sw_vers -productVersion

Install (copy off Desktop/Downloads if TCC blocks installer):
  cp LunaAgent_13plus.pkg /tmp/
  sudo installer -pkg /tmp/LunaAgent_13plus.pkg -target /

Verify:
  shasum -a 256 -c LunaAgent_13plus.pkg.sha256

Full guide:
  https://github.com/mxxnly/Luna-Agent/blob/main/docs/install.md

Channel notes: README-13plus.txt / README-Legacy.txt
